msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Continuous variables are assumed to follow a Gaussian distribution."
msgstr "连续变量被假定服从高斯分布。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Ordinal variables are treated as ordered-categorical; select Blume-Capel if "
"a neutral category is meaningful."
msgstr "有序变量按有序分类变量处理；如果存在有意义的中性类别，请选择 Blume-Capel。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Cases with missing values are excluded listwise."
msgstr "具有缺失值的个案按列表排除。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Variables available for inclusion in the network model."
msgstr "可纳入网络模型的变量。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to include as nodes in the network. Continuous (scale) and "
"ordinal variables are accepted. When a grouping variable is present, a "
"difference network is estimated only if all selected variables are ordinal "
"or Blume-Capel; otherwise separate group networks are estimated."
msgstr ""
"选择要作为网络节点包含的变量。可接受连续（定距）和有序变量。当存在分组变量时"
"，只有当所有选定的变量都是有序或 Blume-Capel 时，才会估计差异网络；否则将分别"
"估计各组的网络。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Blume-Capel / Baseline category"
msgstr "Blume-Capel / 基线类别"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "B-C"
msgstr "B-C"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Treat this ordinal variable using the Blume-Capel parameterization in the "
"OMRF model. Use this when the variable has a meaningful neutral or reference "
"category (e.g., a symmetric Likert scale with a midpoint)."
msgstr ""
"在 OMRF 模型中使用 Blume-Capel 参数化处理该有序变量。当该变量具有有意义的中性"
"或参考类别（例如带有中点的对称李克特量表）时使用此选项。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Baseline"
msgstr "基线"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the neutral or reference category for the Blume-Capel "
"parameterization. Distances between ordinal categories are measured relative "
"to this baseline."
msgstr ""
"为 Blume-Capel 参数化选择中性或参考类别。有序类别之间的距离是相对于该基线测量"
"的。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Compare networks across groups"
msgstr "比较各组之间的网络"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a nominal variable to estimate one network per group. A difference "
"network is estimated only when all selected variables are ordinal or Blume-"
"Capel; if scale variables are included, only separate group networks are "
"estimated. At least 2 groups and 3 observations per group are required."
msgstr ""
"选择一个名义变量以估计每组的网络。只有当选定的变量都是有序或 Blume-Capel 时，"
"才会估计差异网络；如果包含定距变量，则仅估计各组的单独网络。至少需要 2 个组，"
"且每组至少有 3 个观测。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays the posterior mean partial association network. Edge width and "
"color saturation reflect association strength; blue edges are positive and "
"red edges are negative. Edges whose BF₁₀ falls below the inclusion threshold "
"are hidden. Only available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"显示后验均值偏关联网络。边宽和颜色饱和度反映关联强度；蓝色边为正关联，红色边"
"为负关联。BF₁₀ 低于包含阈值的边将被隐藏。仅当未选择分组变量时可用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Edges with BF₁₀ below this value are set to zero in the network plot."
msgstr "在网络图中，BF₁₀ 低于此值的边被设为零。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays the network with edges colored by the evidence category they belong "
"to. Blue edges have BF₁₀ at or above the threshold (evidence for inclusion); "
"yellow edges have BF₁₀ at or below the reciprocal threshold (evidence for "
"exclusion); gray edges fall in between (absence of evidence)."
msgstr ""
"显示的网络中，边按其所属的证据类别着色。蓝色边的 BF₁₀ 等于或高于阈值（包含证"
"据）；黄色边的 BF₁₀ 等于或低于倒数阈值（排除证据）；灰色边介于两者之间（缺乏"
"证据）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"BF threshold for categorizing evidence. An edge is evidence for inclusion if "
"BF₁₀ ≥ threshold, evidence for exclusion if BF₁₀ ≤ 1/threshold, and absence "
"of evidence otherwise."
msgstr ""
"用于对证据进行分类的 BF 阈值。如果 BF₁₀ ≥ 阈值，则边是包含证据；如果 BF₁₀ ≤ "
"1/阈值，则为排除证据；其他情况为缺乏证据。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show edges with BF₁₀ ≥ threshold, colored blue."
msgstr "显示 BF₁₀ ≥ 阈值的边，并着以蓝色。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show edges with BF₁₀ ≤ 1/threshold, colored yellow."
msgstr "显示 BF₁₀ ≤ 1/阈值的边，并着以黄色。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show edges where BF₁₀ falls between the two thresholds, colored gray."
msgstr "显示 BF₁₀ 介于两个阈值之间的边，并着以灰色。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Adds 95% highest density intervals (HDI) to centrality summaries."
msgstr "为中心性汇总添加 95% 最高密度区间（HDI）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Parameter HDI plot"
msgstr "参数 HDI 图"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "HDI coverage:"
msgstr "HDI 覆盖率："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Coverage of the highest density interval (e.g., 0.95 for a 95% HDI)."
msgstr "最高密度区间的覆盖率（例如 95% HDI 为 0.95）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays a heatmap where each cell shows the posterior proportion of the "
"corresponding pairs of nodes belonging to the same cluster. Only available "
"with the Stochastic block model edge prior (see Prior Specification) and no "
"grouping variable."
msgstr ""
"显示热图，其中每个单元格显示相应节点对属于同一聚类的后验比例。仅在使用随机块"
"模型边先验（参见先验设定）且没有分组变量时可用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plots the posterior probability of each sampled graph structure (y-axis) "
"against a structure index (x-axis), sorted in decreasing order of "
"probability. Useful for assessing whether a single graph structure dominates "
"the posterior."
msgstr ""
"绘制每个采样图结构（y 轴）的后验概率相对于结构索引（x 轴）的图形，并按概率降"
"序排列。有助于评估是否存在单一图结构主导后验分布。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plots the summed posterior probability (y-axis) against the number of edges "
"(x-axis). Useful for assessing which network complexities are most supported "
"by the data."
msgstr ""
"绘制汇总的后验概率（y 轴）相对于边数（x 轴）的图形。有助于评估数据最支持哪些"
"网络复杂度。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show estimates on interpretative scale"
msgstr "在解释尺度上显示估计值"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays a symmetric matrix of edge-wise evidence values. All edges are "
"listed regardless of evidence strength."
msgstr "显示边级证据值的对称矩阵。无论证据强弱，所有边都会被列出。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Choose which evidence quantity to display for each edge."
msgstr "选择要为每条边显示的证据量。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Posterior probability that an edge is present, ranging from 0 (no evidence "
"for the edge) to 1 (certain inclusion)."
msgstr "边存在的后验概率，范围从 0（没有边的证据）到 1（确定包含）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Bayes factor quantifying evidence for edge inclusion relative to exclusion. "
"BF₁₀ > 1 favors inclusion; BF₁₀ < 1 favors exclusion."
msgstr ""
"量化边包含相对于排除的证据的贝叶斯因子。BF₁₀ > 1 支持包含；BF₁₀ < 1 支持排"
"除。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Reciprocal Bayes factor quantifying evidence for edge exclusion relative to "
"inclusion. BF₀₁ = 1 / BF₁₀."
msgstr "量化边排除相对于包含的证据的倒数贝叶斯因子。BF₀₁ = 1 / BF₁₀。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Natural logarithm of BF₁₀."
msgstr "BF₁₀ 的自然对数。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shows the posterior probability for every possible number of clusters."
msgstr "显示每个可能的聚类数的后验概率。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Computes a Bayes factor comparing hypotheses about the clustering structure."
msgstr "计算用于比较关于聚类结构的假设的贝叶斯因子。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The BF tests whether any clustered structure is more probable than a single-"
"cluster network."
msgstr "该 BF 检验任何聚类结构是否比单聚类网络更可能出现。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The BF compares the posterior probability of exactly H₁ clusters versus "
"exactly H₂ clusters."
msgstr "该 BF 比较恰好 H₁ 个聚类相对于恰好 H₂ 个聚类的后验概率。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of clusters under hypothesis H₁."
msgstr "假设 H₁ 下的聚类数。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of clusters under hypothesis H₂."
msgstr "假设 H₂ 下的聚类数。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Bernoulli: each edge is independently included with a fixed prior "
"probability. Beta-binomial: edges share a random inclusion probability drawn "
"from a Beta distribution, allowing borrowing of information. Stochastic "
"block: inclusion probabilities depend on latent cluster membership, with "
"separate within- and between-cluster parameters. The Stochastic block option "
"is only available without a grouping variable."
msgstr ""
"Bernoulli：每条边以固定的先验概率独立包含。Beta-二项分布：各边共享一个从 "
"Beta 分布中抽取的随机包含概率，允许信息共享。随机块：包含概率取决于潜在的聚类"
"成员资格，并具有单独的聚类内和聚类间参数。随机块选项仅在无分组变量时可用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 1:"
msgstr "形状参数 1："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 2:"
msgstr "形状参数 2："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta prior on the between-cluster edge "
"inclusion probability."
msgstr "聚类间边包含概率的 Beta 先验的第二个形状参数（α2）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Rate parameter of the truncated Poisson prior on the number of clusters. "
"Smaller values favor fewer clusters."
msgstr "聚类数截断 Poisson 先验的速率参数。较小的值倾向于更少的聚类。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Symmetric Dirichlet concentration parameter for cluster membership "
"probabilities. The default of 1 is roughly uninformative about cluster "
"sizes. Values less than 1 favor unequal cluster sizes."
msgstr ""
"聚类成员资格概率的对称 Dirichlet 集中参数。默认值 1 对聚类大小大致无信息。小"
"于 1 的值倾向于不相等的聚类大小。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior family for the partial association differences:"
msgstr "偏关联差异的先验族："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior family for the partial association parameters:"
msgstr "偏关联参数的先验族："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Cauchy"
msgstr "Cauchy"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Beta-prime"
msgstr "Beta-prime"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Normal distribution for the differences:"
msgstr "差异的 Normal 分布尺度："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Cauchy distribution for the differences:"
msgstr "差异的 Cauchy 分布尺度："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale of the Normal distribution for the partial association parameters:"
msgstr "偏关联参数的 Normal 分布尺度："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale of the Cauchy distribution for the partial association parameters:"
msgstr "偏关联参数的 Cauchy 分布尺度："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 1 for the partial associations:"
msgstr "偏关联的形状参数 1："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta-prime prior on the partial "
"association parameters."
msgstr "偏关联参数的 Beta-prime 先验的第一个形状参数（α1）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 2 for the partial associations:"
msgstr "偏关联的形状参数 2："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta-prime prior on the partial "
"association parameters."
msgstr "偏关联参数的 Beta-prime 先验的第二个形状参数（α2）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior family for the main effects:"
msgstr "主效应的先验族："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Family of the prior on the main effects (thresholds). Beta-prime is the "
"default; Cauchy and Normal are alternative parameterizations on the original "
"scale."
msgstr ""
"主效应（阈值）的先验族。Beta-prime 是默认；Cauchy 和 Normal 是在原始尺度上的"
"替代参数化。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 1 for the main effects:"
msgstr "主效应的形状参数 1："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta-prime prior on the main effects."
msgstr "主效应的 Beta-prime 先验的第一个形状参数（α1）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 2 for the main effects:"
msgstr "主效应的形状参数 2："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta-prime prior on the main effects."
msgstr "主效应的 Beta-prime 先验的第二个形状参数（α2）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Normal distribution for the main effects:"
msgstr "主效应的 Normal 分布尺度："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Cauchy distribution for the main effects:"
msgstr "主效应的 Cauchy 分布尺度："

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale parameter of the Cauchy or Normal prior on the main effects."
msgstr "主效应 Cauchy 或 Normal 先验的尺度参数。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of warmup iterations discarded from the start of each chain to allow "
"the Markov chain to converge before collecting posterior samples."
msgstr ""
"从每条链开始丢弃的预热迭代次数，以便在收集后验样本之前让马尔可夫链收敛。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of independent MCMC chains. With 2 or more chains, the Gelman-Rubin R-"
"hat convergence statistic is computed across all chains. With 1 chain, a "
"split-chain version is used instead. R-hat values above approximately 1.05 "
"suggest the chains have not converged."
msgstr ""
"独立 MCMC 链的数量。当有 2 个或更多链时，会跨所有链计算 Gelman-Rubin R-hat 收"
"敛统计量。只有 1 条链时，则使用分裂链版本。R-hat 值大于约 1.05 表明链尚未收"
"敛。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Define named groups for manual node coloring. Each group can be assigned a "
"color that will appear in the network plot when Manual colors is enabled."
msgstr ""
"定义用于手动节点着色的命名组。启用“手动调色”时，可为每个组分配一个将出现在网"
"络图中的颜色。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Assign each network variable to one of the color groups defined on the left. "
"All variables start in Group 1 by default."
msgstr ""
"将每个网络变量分配到左侧定义的颜色组之一。默认情况下，所有变量都从分组 1 开"
"始。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When enabled, node colors are taken from the group color assignments above. "
"When disabled, a predefined palette is applied uniformly."
msgstr ""
"启用后，节点颜色取自上述的组颜色分配。禁用后，将统一应用预定义的调色板。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Color palette applied to node groups when Manual colors is disabled. "
"Colorblind-safe options are recommended for accessible figures."
msgstr ""
"禁用“手动调色”时应用于节点组的调色板。为便于无障碍访问的图形，建议使用色盲安"
"全选项。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Multiplier applied to all node sizes. A value of 1 uses the default size; "
"values above 1 create larger nodes."
msgstr ""
"应用于所有节点大小的倍数。值 1 使用默认大小；大于 1 的值会创建更大的节点。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Multiplier applied to all edge widths. A value of 2 doubles the edge width "
"relative to the default."
msgstr "应用于所有边宽的倍数。值 2 使边宽相对于默认值加倍。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Sets the edge weight that corresponds to the maximum line width. Edges "
"stronger than this value are clipped to the maximum width. Set to 0 to scale "
"all edges relative to the strongest edge."
msgstr ""
"设置与最大线宽对应的边权重。大于此值的边将被裁剪为最大宽度。设为 0 可相对于最"
"强边缩放所有边。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Edges with absolute weight below this value are hidden in the network plot. "
"If the threshold exceeds the strongest edge, it is ignored and a warning is "
"shown in the summary table."
msgstr ""
"绝对权重低于此值的边将在网络图中隐藏。如果阈值超过最强边，则忽略该阈值并在汇"
"总表中显示警告。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Edges with absolute weight below this value are drawn thin and desaturated; "
"above it they scale to full width and saturation. Set to 0 to scale all "
"edges continuously without a cut threshold."
msgstr ""
"绝对权重低于此值的边将绘制得细且去饱和；高于此值的边将缩放为完整宽度和饱和"
"度。设为 0 可在无削减阈值的情况下连续缩放所有边。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Overlays the minimum edge strength, maximum edge strength, and cut values as "
"text on the network plot."
msgstr "在网络图上以文本方式叠加显示最小边强度、最大边强度和削减值。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Overlay the numerical edge weight on each edge in the network plot."
msgstr "在网络图中将数值边权重叠加显示在每条边上。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Multiplier for edge label size."
msgstr "边标签大小的倍数。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Position of edge labels along each edge (0 to 1)."
msgstr "边标签沿每条边的位置（0 到 1）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Color scheme applied to positive and negative edges. Classic uses blue for "
"positive and red for negative associations. Colorblind-safe and grayscale "
"options are also available."
msgstr ""
"应用于正负边的配色方案。经典方案对正关联使用蓝色，对负关联使用红色。还提供色"
"盲安全和灰阶选项。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Multiplier for node label font size. A value of 2 doubles the label size "
"relative to the default."
msgstr "节点标签字体大小的倍数。值 2 使标签大小相对于默认值加倍。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When enabled, label font size is automatically scaled relative to node size "
"so that labels fit inside nodes."
msgstr "启用后，标签字体大小会根据节点大小自动缩放，以便标签适合节点内部。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Abbreviate variable names in plots to reduce label clutter."
msgstr "在图形中缩写变量名称以减少标签杂乱。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Target character length for abbreviated labels."
msgstr "缩写标签的目标字符长度。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Choose where variable names are displayed in network plots."
msgstr "选择在网络图中显示变量名称的位置。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable names are shown as labels directly on the nodes."
msgstr "变量名称作为标签直接显示在节点上。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Nodes are labeled with numbers; a legend maps each number to the variable "
"name. Useful when variable names are long."
msgstr "节点以数字标记；图例将每个数字映射到变量名称。当变量名称较长时很有用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Controls legend placement across network plots. When multiple networks are "
"shown (e.g., with grouping), this setting applies globally."
msgstr "控制网络图的图例位置。当显示多个网络（例如带分组）时，此设置全局生效。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "No legend is shown in any plot."
msgstr "在任何图形中都不显示图例。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "A legend is added to every network plot."
msgstr "向每个网络图添加图例。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"A legend is added to only the plot with the specified number, and other "
"plots are shown without a legend."
msgstr "仅向具有指定编号的图形添加图例，其他图形则不显示图例。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "1-based index of the plot in which the legend should appear."
msgstr "应显示图例的图形的从 1 开始的索引。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Width of the legend panel relative to the network plot. A value of 0.4 means "
"the legend is 40% as wide as the plot."
msgstr "图例面板相对于网络图的宽度。值 0.4 表示图例宽度为图形的 40%。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Determines how nodes are positioned in network plots. The same layout is "
"applied to all networks in a multi-network analysis, computed from the "
"average of estimated edge weights."
msgstr ""
"决定网络图中节点的定位方式。在多网络分析中，相同的布局应用于所有网络，该布局"
"由估计边权重的平均值计算得出。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Nodes are positioned using the Fruchterman-Reingold force-directed "
"algorithm. Strongly connected nodes are placed closer together."
msgstr ""
"节点使用 Fruchterman-Reingold 力导向算法定位。连接较强的节点放置得更近。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Controls how strongly nodes repel each other. Larger values spread nodes "
"further apart."
msgstr "控制节点之间相互排斥的强度。较大的值会使节点分散得更远。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Nodes are evenly spaced on a circle. Useful for comparing relative edge "
"patterns without the layout reflecting association strength."
msgstr ""
"节点在圆上均匀分布。适用于在布局不反映关联强度的情况下比较相对边的模式。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of shortest paths between other node pairs that pass through this "
"node. Nodes with high betweenness act as bridges in the network."
msgstr ""
"经过此节点的其他节点对之间的最短路径数量。介数较高的节点在网络中充当桥梁。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Inverse of the average shortest path length from this node to all other "
"nodes. Nodes with high closeness can efficiently reach all other nodes."
msgstr ""
"从该节点到所有其他节点的平均最短路径长度的倒数。接近度较高的节点可以有效到达"
"所有其他节点。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Sum of absolute edge weights connected to this node. Reflects how strongly a "
"node is associated with its neighbors."
msgstr "与该节点相连的边权重的绝对值之和。反映节点与其邻居的关联强度。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Sum of signed edge weights connected to this node. Unlike strength, negative "
"edges reduce the value, so nodes with mixed positive and negative "
"connections may have low expected influence."
msgstr ""
"与该节点相连的带符号边权重之和。与强度不同，负边会降低该值，因此具有正负混合"
"连接的节点可能具有较低的期望影响。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The module supports the Gaussian graphical model (for continuous variables), "
"the ordinal Markov random field, for ordinal (and binary) variables "
"including Blume-Capel parameterizations when the ordinal variables with more "
"than two categories have a meaningful neutral category, as well as a mixed "
"graphical model of continuous and ordinal (Blume-Capel) variables.\n"
msgstr ""
"本模块支持高斯图模型（用于连续变量）、有序马尔可夫随机场（用于有序（及二值）"
"变量，包括当具有两个以上类别的有序变量存在有意义的中性类别时的 Blume-Capel 参"
"数化），以及连续变量与有序（Blume-Capel）变量的混合图模型。\n"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When a grouping factor variable is supplied, one network is estimated per "
"group. A statistical comparison of network differences is available if all "
"selected variables are ordinal or Blume-Capel; otherwise, only group-"
"specific networks are estimated.\n"
msgstr ""
"提供分组因子变量时，将为每个组估计一个网络。仅当所有选定变量均为有序或 Blume-"
"Capel 变量时，才可进行网络差异的统计比较；否则仅估计各组特有的网络。\n"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays centrality for the selected measures (betweenness, closeness, "
"strength, expected influence), standardized to z-scores across nodes. "
"Centrality is computed on the posterior mean network, or averaged over the "
"networks sampled from the posterior when the credibility interval is "
"requested. Measures are plotted side by side per node. Only available when "
"no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"显示所选指标的中心性（介数、接近度、强度、期望影响），并按节点标准化为 z 分数"
"。中心性基于后验均值网络计算；当请求可信区间时，则对从后验中采样的网络取平均"
"。各指标按节点并排绘制。仅在未选择分组变量时可用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays the posterior mean and highest density interval (HDI) for every "
"pairwise partial association, ordered from smallest to largest posterior "
"mean. Only available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"显示每一对偏关联的后验均值与最高密度区间（HDI），按后验均值从小到大排序。仅在"
"未选择分组变量时可用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Shows one row per edge, listed by variable pair. Columns include the "
"posterior estimate, inclusion probability, inclusion Bayes factor, an "
"evidence category, and the R-hat convergence statistic. When Blume-Capel "
"variables are selected, an additional table reports the posterior mean, "
"standard deviation, credible interval and R-hat of their linear and "
"quadratic main effects."
msgstr ""
"每个边显示一行，按变量对列出。各列包括后验估计、包含概率、包含贝叶斯因子、证"
"据类别以及 R-hat 收敛统计量。选择 Blume-Capel 变量时，另有一张表报告其线性与"
"二次主效应的后验均值、标准差、可信区间和 R-hat。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"BF threshold used to categorize the edges in the overview table: included if "
"BF₁₀ ≥ threshold, excluded if BF₁₀ ≤ 1/threshold, and inconclusive "
"otherwise. All edges remain listed. When comparing groups the categories are "
"labelled difference, equal, and inconclusive. The same threshold drives the "
"edge counts in the summary table."
msgstr ""
"用于对概览表中的边进行分类的 BF 阈值：若 BF₁₀ ≥ 阈值则归为包含，若 BF₁₀ ≤ 1/"
"阈值则归为排除，否则为尚无定论。所有边仍会列出。比较组时，类别标为差异、相等"
"和尚无定论。汇总表中的边计数也使用同一阈值。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shows log-odds and partial correlations when available."
msgstr "在可用时显示对数优势比和偏相关。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Shows the betweenness, closeness, strength, and expected influence of each "
"node, standardized to z-scores across nodes. Centrality is computed on the "
"posterior mean network, or averaged over the networks sampled from the "
"posterior when the credibility interval of the centrality plot is requested. "
"Only available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"显示每个节点的介数、接近度、强度和期望影响，并按节点标准化为 z 分数。中心性基"
"于后验均值网络计算；当请求中心性图的可信区间时，则对从后验中采样的网络取平均"
"。仅在未选择分组变量时可用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Parameter HDI table"
msgstr "参数 HDI 表"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Shows the posterior mean and highest density interval (HDI) for every "
"pairwise partial association, ordered from largest to smallest posterior "
"mean so that it reads like the parameter HDI plot. The posterior mean "
"averages over all posterior samples, so an edge that is mostly excluded can "
"have a nonzero mean while its HDI collapses onto zero. The estimate of the "
"median probability model, which sets edges with a posterior inclusion "
"probability of at most 0.5 to zero, is shown in a separate column. Only "
"available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"显示每一对偏关联的后验均值与最高密度区间（HDI），按后验均值从大到小排序，使其"
"阅读方式与参数 HDI 图一致。后验均值是对所有后验样本的平均，因此一个大多被排除"
"的边可能具有非零均值，而其 HDI 会收缩到零。中位概率模型的估计——将后验包含概率"
"至多为 0.5 的边设为零——显示在单独的列中。仅在未选择分组变量时可用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Shows the estimated cluster membership for each node. The allocation is "
"summarized by either the posterior mean or the posterior mode allocation."
msgstr "显示每个节点的估计聚类归属。分配结果以后验均值或后验众数归类进行汇总。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Posterior mean is the sampled allocation that best represents the posterior "
"co-clustering matrix (Dahl, 2009), a representative partition rather than an "
"average of cluster indices. Posterior mode uses the most frequently sampled "
"cluster assignment."
msgstr ""
"后验均值是指最能代表后验共聚类矩阵（Dahl, 2009）的采样分配，是一种代表性划分"
"，而不是聚类索引的平均。后验众数使用采样最频繁的聚类分配。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Posterior probabilities for clusters"
msgstr "聚类的后验概率"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Clustering vs. no clustering compares the hypothesis of a multi-cluster "
"solution against the hypothesis of a single-cluster (no clustering) model. "
"Point hypotheses compare two specific numbers of clusters."
msgstr ""
"“有聚类 vs. 无聚类”将多簇解的假设与单簇（无聚类）模型的假设进行比较。点假设比"
"较两个特定的聚类数。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Prior probability that any given edge is present under the Bernoulli prior. "
"The default of 0.5 assigns equal prior probability to inclusion and "
"exclusion. Values closer to 0 impose a sparser prior. The probability must "
"lie strictly between 0 and 1."
msgstr ""
"在 Bernoulli 先验下，任意给定边存在的先验概率。默认值 0.5 对包含与排除赋予相"
"等的先验概率。值越接近 0，先验越稀疏。该概率必须严格介于 0 和 1 之间。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta prior on the edge inclusion "
"probability; under the Stochastic block model it applies to the within-"
"cluster inclusion probability. Together with shape parameter 2 it controls "
"the prior mean (α1 / (α1 + α2)) and concentration. Both parameters equal to "
"1 give a uniform prior."
msgstr ""
"边包含概率的 Beta 先验的第一形状参数（α1）；在随机块模型下，它适用于簇内包含"
"概率。与形状参数 2 一起，它控制先验均值（α1 / (α1 + α2)）和集中度。两个参数都"
"等于 1 时得到均匀先验。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta prior on the edge inclusion "
"probability; under the Stochastic block model it applies to the within-"
"cluster inclusion probability. Both parameters equal to 1 give a uniform "
"prior."
msgstr ""
"边包含概率的 Beta 先验的第二形状参数（α2）；在随机块模型下，它适用于簇内包含"
"概率。两个参数都等于 1 时得到均匀先验。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta prior on the between-cluster edge "
"inclusion probability. The prior mean of that probability is α1 / (α1 + α2), "
"so to encourage sparsity between clusters (block structure), choose shape "
"parameter 2 larger than shape parameter 1."
msgstr ""
"簇间边包含概率的 Beta 先验的第一形状参数（α1）。该概率的先验均值为 α1 / (α1 "
"+ α2)，因此若要在簇间鼓励稀疏性（块结构），应选择比形状参数 1 更大的形状参数 "
"2。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Family of the prior on the partial association parameters. Normal is the "
"default and applies lighter-tailed shrinkage. Cauchy is a heavy-tailed "
"shrinkage prior. Beta-prime is parameterized via two shape parameters on the "
"logistic scale and is only available when all selected variables are ordinal "
"or Blume-Capel. When a grouping variable is selected this family applies to "
"the baseline partial associations; the prior on the group differences is set "
"separately below."
msgstr ""
"偏关联参数的先验族。Normal 为默认值，适用较轻尾的收缩。Cauchy 为重尾收缩先验"
"。Beta-prime 通过 logit 尺度上的两个形状参数进行参数化，仅当所有选定变量均为"
"有序或 Blume-Capel 时可用。选择分组变量时，该先验族适用于基线偏关联；组间差异"
"的先验在下方单独设置。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale of the Normal or Cauchy prior on the partial association parameters "
"when a grouping variable is selected. It applies to the separate group and "
"pooled networks, and to the baseline partial associations of the difference "
"network. The scale of the prior on the group differences is set separately "
"below."
msgstr ""
"选择分组变量时，偏关联参数上 Normal 或 Cauchy 先验的尺度。它适用于各组网络和"
"合并网络，以及差异网络的基线偏关联。组间差异先验的尺度在下方单独设置。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Family of the prior on the differences in partial association between the "
"groups. Normal is the default and bounds a difference more tightly; Cauchy "
"is heavy-tailed and leaves more room for large differences. Only used when a "
"difference network is estimated, which requires a grouping variable and all "
"selected variables to be ordinal or Blume-Capel."
msgstr ""
"组间偏关联差异的先验族。Normal 为默认值，对差异的约束更紧；Cauchy 为重尾，允"
"许更大的差异。仅在估计差异网络时使用，这需要分组变量且所有选定变量均为有序或 "
"Blume-Capel。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale parameter of the Normal or Cauchy prior on the partial association "
"parameters. When a grouping variable is selected, this is instead the scale "
"of the prior on the differences between groups, which is only used when a "
"difference network is estimated (all selected variables ordinal or Blume-"
"Capel)."
msgstr ""
"偏关联参数上 Normal 或 Cauchy 先验的尺度参数。选择分组变量时，这改为组间差异"
"先验的尺度，仅在估计差异网络时使用（所有选定变量为有序或 Blume-Capel）。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Burn-in: "
msgstr "预热： "

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of posterior samples retained per chain, drawn after the burn-in "
"iterations. The total length of each chain is the burn-in plus this number. "
"Increase for more stable estimates, especially for complex models."
msgstr ""
"每条链在预热迭代后保留的后验样本数。每条链的总长度为预热数加此数量。增加该值"
"可获得更稳定的估计，尤其适用于复杂模型。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"MCMC algorithm used to sample from the posterior. NUTS is the gradient-based "
"No-U-Turn sampler and is available for every variable type. Adaptive "
"Metropolis is a componentwise random-walk sampler. Gibbs draws the precision "
"matrix in conjugate row blocks and is only available for the Gaussian "
"graphical model, that is, when all variables are continuous. With a grouping "
"variable it can still be used for the separate group networks, but not for "
"the estimation of a difference network."
msgstr ""
"用于从后验采样的 MCMC 算法。NUTS 是基于梯度的 No-U-Turn 采样器，适用于所有变"
"量类型。Adaptive Metropolis 是逐分量的随机游走采样器。Gibbs 以共轭行块抽取精"
"度矩阵，仅适用于高斯图模型，即所有变量均为连续变量时。存在分组变量时，它仍可"
"用于各组网络，但不能用于差异网络的估计。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Gibbs"
msgstr "Gibbs"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Color assigned to this group. Only used when Manual colors is enabled."
msgstr "分配给该组的颜色。仅在启用“手动颜色”时使用。"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Color group this variable belongs to."
msgstr "该变量所属的颜色组。"
